* leung_dfcfc2_pin_3 -- AnalogGym topology on TSMC12 BSIM-CMG (LEVEL=72)
* Connectivity and mirror ratios are the shipped ones; geometry is re-designed for 0.8 V FinFET.
.subckt leung_dfcfc2_pin_3 gnda vdda vinn vinp vout
Nm12 VOUT net050 VDDA VDDA psvt_l36_f6 m=7   $ gmf2_PMOS
Nm7 net049 net1 VDDA VDDA psvt_l240_f7 m=3   $ BIASCM_PMOS
